# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Build-context hygiene.
#
#  The web image is built from the REPO ROOT (compose: context ../.., see
#  apps/web/Dockerfile) so that packages/ is reachable - which means every
#  file under the root is shipped to the Docker daemon unless excluded here.
#  With no .dockerignore, the untracked 11 GB backups/ folder rode along on
#  every web build, each build left an ~11 GB entry in the build cache, and
#  ten of them filled the production disk to 100% on 5 Sept 2026.
#
#  Nothing below is needed inside any image: the Dockerfiles copy source,
#  package manifests and packages/, and never read .git or a host build.
#  .env files are deliberately NOT excluded - Next may read them at build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
backups/
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
